  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For some reason my safety settings completely stopped working last night. No matter if I set it to max or my custom where I have it set to friends only being shown, it'll still try to load in everyone's avatars that weren't fallbacks. Trying to manually turn everyone's avatars off wasn't working either. I even tried adjusting the max performance and file size settings and while that helped a little, there were still avatars that were getting past that.\nI've tried reinstalling vrchat and clearing cache and still haven't found a solution. I wish I knew how to recreate it cause it's been a serious hassle for me.",
